                "description": "This Wilshire 8 Inch Pull will fit doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick and comes packaged with everything you'll need to thru-bolt mount it on a wood, fiberglass, or metal door. The Wilshire Door Pull is available in a huge selection of finishes including black, polished nickel, and polished brass for an end look that will show off your personal style. \r\n",
